    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0152",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u738b\u5148\u751f\u4eca\u5929\u7a7f\u4e86\u4e00\u4ef6\u767d\u8272\u7684\u8863\u670d\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "Mr. Wang is wearing a white piece of clothing today.",
        "notes": "W\u00e1ng xi\u0101nsheng j\u012bnti\u0101n chu\u0101nle y\u012b ji\u00e0n b\u00e1is\u00e8 de y\u012bfu.\n\n\u767d (b\u00e1i) - white; appears in \u767d\u8272 (white-colored)"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0153",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u9019\u5bb6\u5546\u5e97\u88e1\u6709\u4e09\u767e\u591a\u672c\u6f22\u8a9e\u66f8\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "There are more than three hundred Chinese books in this shop.",
        "notes": "Zh\u00e8 ji\u0101 sh\u0101ngdi\u00e0n l\u01d0 y\u01d2u s\u0101n b\u01cei du\u014d b\u011bn H\u00e0ny\u01d4 sh\u016b.\n\n\u767e (b\u01cei) - hundred; \u4e09\u767e (three hundred)"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0154",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u91ab\u751f\u8aaa\u5e6b\u52a9\u75c5\u4eba\u662f\u4ed6\u6700\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "The doctor says helping patients is his most important job.",
        "notes": "Y\u012bsh\u0113ng shu\u014d b\u0101ngzh\u00f9 b\u00ecngr\u00e9n sh\u00ec t\u0101 zu\u00ec zh\u00f2ngy\u00e0o de g\u014dngzu\u00f2.\n\n\u5e6b\u52a9 (b\u0101ngzh\u00f9) - to help / to assist"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0155",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u6211\u7238\u7238\u6bcf\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u90fd\u770b\u5831\u7d19\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "My father reads the newspaper every morning.",
        "notes": "W\u01d2 b\u00e0ba m\u011biti\u0101n z\u01ceoshang d\u014du k\u00e0n b\u00e0ozh\u01d0.\n\n\u5831\u7d19 (b\u00e0ozh\u01d0) - newspaper"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0156",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u6211\u59d0\u59d0\u6bd4\u6211\u9ad8\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "My older sister is taller than me.",
        "notes": "W\u01d2 ji\u011bjie b\u01d0 w\u01d2 g\u0101o.\n\n\u6bd4 (b\u01d0) - than; used in comparisons"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0157",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u5abd\u5abd\u8aaa\u5225\u5728\u684c\u5b50\u4e0a\u5beb\u5b57\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "Mother says don't write on the table.",
        "notes": "M\u0101m\u0101 shu\u014d bi\u00e9 z\u00e0i zhu\u014dzi sh\u00e0ng xi\u011b z\u00ec.\n\n\u5225 (bi\u00e9) - don't; prohibitive adverb"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0158",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u9019\u689d\u8def\u5f88\u9577,\u6211\u5011\u5750\u51fa\u79df\u8eca\u53bb\u5427\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "This road is very long; let's take a taxi.",
        "notes": "Zh\u00e8 ti\u00e1o l\u00f9 h\u011bn ch\u00e1ng, w\u01d2men zu\u00f2 ch\u016bz\u016bch\u0113 q\u00f9 ba.\n\n\u9577 (ch\u00e1ng) - long"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0159",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u6211\u5f88\u9ad8\u8208\u80fd\u548c\u4f60\u4e00\u8d77\u5531\u6b4c\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "I am very glad to be able to sing with you.",
        "notes": "W\u01d2 h\u011bn g\u0101ox\u00ecng n\u00e9ng h\u00e9 n\u01d0 y\u012bq\u01d0 ch\u00e0ngg\u0113.\n\n\u5531\u6b4c (ch\u00e0ngg\u0113) - to sing (songs)"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mandarin_reading-2026-09-06-hsk-0160",
      "front": {
        "text": "\u660e\u5929\u4e0a\u5348\u6211\u5011\u8981\u51fa\u53bb\u8cb7\u6771\u897f\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "Tomorrow morning we are going out to buy things.",
        "notes": "M\u00edngti\u0101n sh\u00e0ngw\u01d4 w\u01d2men y\u00e0o ch\u016bq\u00f9 m\u01cei d\u014dngxi.\n\n\u51fa (ch\u016b) - to go out; \u51fa\u53bb (to go out)"
      },
      "available_at": "2026-09-05T17:24:00.504659Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
